MODULE: CheckpointWithinAppliedSwapDiscardsLog
TARGET: CheckpointWithinApplied
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an identity swap discards the retained pre-swap log the view is still bound to
PERTURBS: SourceSwap

--- FIND
    /\ alias' = "P2" /\ swapped' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<logs, written, EnvVars, ViewVars>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ alias' = "P2" /\ swapped' = TRUE
    /\ logs' = [logs EXCEPT !["P1"] = <<>>]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<written, EnvVars, ViewVars>>
--- END
